// /Hints/Stamps/Links:Remove Link From

// This stamp allows a third-party execution context to
// remove a link from a specified note to the Stamp's target.
// For this to work, the Stamp target (i.e., “this”) must have
// these attribute assignments:
//   $MyNumber(target) contains the $ID of the from-note
//   $MyString(target) optionally provides the Link Type
//
// The third-party will set these attributes in the target,
// and then execute:
//    stamp(target,"Links:Remove Link From");

// LogRec(StampLog,"source: "+$MyNumber+" dest: "+$ID+" type: "+$MyString);

unlinkFrom($MyNumber,$MyString);



